  "_README": "THE GAMES MANIFEST — one list, two readers. Canonical copy lives here at builds/_shared/games.json. It is copied into flashpoint-landing/public/ and thearena/public/ by builds/_shared/sync-games.sh at build time. Edit THIS file, run the script, rebuild. Never edit a copy in a public/ folder — it is overwritten.",
